{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexLeftProjector","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexLeftProjector","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.QuarkState.LeftLineDefinition"],"declarations":14,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexLeftProjector.insertion_eq_zero_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexLeftProjector.insertion_eq_zero_iff","kind":"theorem","line":167,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakVertexLeftProjector.lean#L167-L176","doc":"The insertion vanishes iff `h = 0`, provided the left line is nonzero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexLeftProjector.skein_eq_neg_bracket_insertion","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexLeftProjector.skein_eq_neg_bracket_insertion","kind":"theorem","line":160,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakVertexLeftProjector.lean#L160-L165","doc":"**The skein difference is the insertion up to `−[2]`** (`|q| > 1`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexLeftProjector.skein_dominant_root","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexLeftProjector.skein_dominant_root","kind":"theorem","line":143,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakVertexLeftProjector.lean#L143-L158","doc":"**Skein form, label-free.** Weight the positive crossing by its own eigenvalue `t` of\nmodulus `> 1`, whichever root label (`q` or `−q⁻¹`) that is. The difference is then\n`(t − t⁻¹)(t + t⁻¹)·leftLine`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexLeftProjector.skein_eq_rightLine","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexLeftProjector.skein_eq_rightLine","kind":"theorem","line":138,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakVertexLeftProjector.lean#L138-L141","doc":"**Skein form, `|q| ≤ 1`.** The same weighting then gives the right line. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexLeftProjector.skein_eq_leftLine","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexLeftProjector.skein_eq_leftLine","kind":"theorem","line":133,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakVertexLeftProjector.lean#L133-L136","doc":"**Skein form, `|q| > 1`.** The `q`-weighted skein difference is `h·[2]·leftLine`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexLeftProjector.one_sided_iff_smul_leftLine","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexLeftProjector.one_sided_iff_smul_leftLine","kind":"theorem","line":119,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakVertexLeftProjector.lean#L119-L131","doc":"**One-sided ⇔ proportional to the left projector**, inside the letter algebra. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexLeftProjector.leftLine_idem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexLeftProjector.leftLine_idem","kind":"theorem","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakVertexLeftProjector.lean#L112-L117","doc":"The left line is idempotent. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexLeftProjector.insertion_mul_leftLine","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexLeftProjector.insertion_mul_leftLine","kind":"theorem","line":106,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakVertexLeftProjector.lean#L106-L110","doc":"On the left line the insertion acts by the scalar `−h`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexLeftProjector.insertion_mul_rightLine","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexLeftProjector.insertion_mul_rightLine","kind":"theorem","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakVertexLeftProjector.lean#L100-L104","doc":"The insertion annihilates the right line: the right line does not couple. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexLeftProjector.weakVertex_sub_letter","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexLeftProjector.weakVertex_sub_letter","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakVertexLeftProjector.lean#L91-L98","doc":"**D-H3, letter level (derived).** The vertex insertion `weakVertex − σ` equals\n`−(q − q⁻¹)` times the left projector, in both regimes. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:weak-vertex-left-projector","label":"prop:weak-vertex-left-projector","md":"quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/weak-vertex-left-projector.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexLeftProjector.weakVertex_eq_split","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexLeftProjector.weakVertex_eq_split","kind":"theorem","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakVertexLeftProjector.lean#L85-L89","doc":"**The weak vertex as a split**: `σ⁻¹` on the left line, `σ` on the right line. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexLeftProjector.flip_sub_self","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexLeftProjector.flip_sub_self","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakVertexLeftProjector.lean#L80-L83","doc":"`σ⁻¹ − σ = −h`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexLeftProjector.leftLine_mul_rightLine","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexLeftProjector.leftLine_mul_rightLine","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakVertexLeftProjector.lean#L72-L77","doc":"The two lines are orthogonal. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexLeftProjector.split_lines","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.WeakVertexLeftProjector.split_lines","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/WeakVertexLeftProjector.lean#L67-L70","doc":"Every element splits along the two lines. ","signatureChunk":0}]}